docs {
  # WADO-RS: Render Instance

  Render a DICOM image as PNG.

  ## Path Parameters
  - `studyUID`: Study Instance UID
  - `seriesUID`: Series Instance UID
  - `sopInstanceUID`: SOP Instance UID

  ## Response
  PNG image (image/png)
}
